# Product API

- One procedure per file in `src/routers/<domain>/`, exported from the domain `index.ts`; `router.ts` only composes domains.
- Build from `pub` or `authed` (`base.ts`); validate with Zod; auth stays on `auth.api`.
- Test with `call` / `createRouterClient` and a mocked `@repo/auth` (`src/base.test.ts`).

Guide: [docs/agents/api.md](docs/agents/api.md)
